<http://example.org/Albert_Einstein> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Albert Einstein" .
<http://example.org/Marie_Curie> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Marie Curie" .
