# --- Awards ---
<http://example.org/Albert_Einstein> <http://example.org/award> "Nobel Prize in Physics 1921" .
<http://example.org/Marie_Curie> <http://example.org/award> "Nobel Prize in Physics 1903" .
<http://example.org/Marie_Curie> <http://example.org/award> "Nobel Prize in Chemistry 1911" .
<http://example.org/Isaac_Newton> <http://example.org/award> "Fellow of the Royal Society" .

